This project was developed from experiments conducted on the URF-HVAA
codebase:

  A Unified Reasoning Framework for Holistic Zero-Shot Video Anomaly Analysis
  https://github.com/Rathgrith/URF-HVAA

It uses VideoLLaMA3 through Hugging Face Transformers remote model code:

  https://huggingface.co/DAMO-NLP-SG/VideoLLaMA3-7B

Model weights, dataset media, evaluation annotations, FFmpeg, CUDA, PyTorch,
and other third-party components are not covered by this project's MIT
License. Users must comply with their respective licenses and terms. No model
weights or dataset media are distributed. Copies of the exact evaluation index
and temporal annotation text used to reproduce the bundled scores are included
under results/ for research reproducibility.
